    "chunk_text": "\u00fea ofermodan under heora fotum, and \u00feara synfullena handa me na ne styrien. Ac under heora fet, and under heora handa, gefeallen ealle \u00fea \u00fee unriht wyrcen; and him \u00fe\u00e6t lica\u00f0, Ne wundrie ge \u00fe\u00e6ra yfelwillendra, and \u00fe\u00e6ra orsorgra, ne him na ne onhyria\u00f0; ne eow ne of\u00feince, For \u00fe\u00e6m swy\u00fee hra\u00fee forsearia\u00f0 swa file\u00f0e, and hy gefealla\u00f0 swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice, swa swa wyrta leaf, Ac \u00feu hopa to Drihtne, and do good, and buwa eor\u00f0an, and fed \u00fee on hyre welum. And blissa on Drihtne, \u00feonne syle\u00f0 he \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu bidst on \u00feinum mode. Onwreoh Gode \u00feine wegas, and hopa to him; he \u00fee gede\u00f0 fultum. And he gede\u00f0 \u00feine rihtwisnesse mannum swa sweotole swa sunnan, and \u00feinne dom he gede\u00f0 swa Beo \u00feu Gode under\u00feyd, and halsa hine; and ne onhyre \u00feam \u00fee by\u00f0 orsorh on his wege, and wyrc\u00f0 Forl\u00e6t yrre and hatheortnesse; ne bysna \u00fee be nanum \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fee yfel don. For \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fea \u00fee yfel do\u00f0, and \u00fe\u00e6t ne beta\u00f0, hy beo\u00f0 awyrtwalode of eor\u00fean; ac \u00fea \u00fee to Gode hopia\u00f0, Gebid ane lytle hwile, \u00feonne ne by\u00f0 se synfulla; \u00feeah \u00feu \u00feonne sece his stowe, \u00feonne ne findst \u00feu Ac \u00fea man\u00few\u00e6ran gesitta\u00f0 eor\u00fean, and f\u00e6gnia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re myclan sibbe. Se synfulla s\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s rihtwisan, and gristbita\u00f0 mid his to\u00feum ongean hine",
